    USER -->|request| PINGSESS
    PINGSESS --> CHATB
    PINGSESS --> GPTD
    CHATB -->|JSON-RPC| AGENT1
    GPTD -->|JSON-RPC| AGENT1
    AGENT1 --- LLM
    PINGSESS -.->|authn| ATS
    ATS --- ATSSUB
    AUTHZ --- ATS
    AUTHZ -.->|introspect| ATS
    ATS -.->|request token| AGENT1
